What this covers
----------------

The original work in this repository: the Qt/QML desktop shell under
shell-qt/, the live-build configuration under distro/, the build scripts, and
the documentation.

What it does not cover
----------------------

An ISO built from this repository is an aggregate. Everything Debian ships
inside it — the kernel, Qt, labwc, NetworkManager, BlueZ, Calamares, the
security tools — keeps its own licence, and several of those are GPL. Building
and redistributing an image means honouring those licences too; this file says
nothing about them.

shell-qt/protocols/wlr-foreign-toplevel-management-unstable-v1.xml is not our
work. It is MIT, copyright 2018 Ilia Bozhinov, vendored from wlr-protocols;
its own notice is in the file.
